{"id":"35ef9870c318436f","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-first-order-ultraproduct.md","title":"First-Order Ultraproduct","display":"df-first-order-ultraproduct — First-Order Ultraproduct","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-first-order-ultraproduct","aliases":["93-df-first-order-ultraproduct"],"display":"df-first-order-ultraproduct — First-Order Ultraproduct","depends_on":["[[93-df-first-order-language]]","[[93-df-first-order-structure]]","[[93-df-set-ultrafilter]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-first-order-ultraproduct"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-first-order-ultraproduct</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-ultraproduct — First-Order Ultraproduct"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cc9bc888c7dda430\" href=\"?note=cc9bc888c7dda430\" title=\"93-df-first-order-language\">93-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0ce709e0d2857990\" href=\"?note=0ce709e0d2857990\" title=\"93-df-first-order-structure\">93-df-first-order-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7cc13e0d91069bbd\" href=\"?note=7cc13e0d91069bbd\" title=\"93-df-set-ultrafilter\">93-df-set-ultrafilter</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in V\">\\(I\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\neq\\varnothing\">\\(I\\neq\\varnothing\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A:I\\to V\">\\(\\mathfrak A:I\\to V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A(i),\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A(i),\\mathcal L)\\)</span> for every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in I\">\\(i\\in I\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}\\)</span> are sourced from the first-order language encoded in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cc9bc888c7dda430\" href=\"?note=cc9bc888c7dda430\" title=\"93-df-first-order-language\">93-df-first-order-language</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}\">\\(P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UClass}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{UClass}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}\">\\(D^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FOUClassTuple}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{FOUClassTuple}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FOUVal}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{FOUVal}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UFun}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{UFun}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{URel}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{URel}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UFunFam}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{UFunFam}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{URelFam}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{URelFam}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\nP^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\coloneqq\n\\prod_{i\\in I}|\\mathfrak A(i)|\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\nP^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\coloneqq\n\\prod_{i\\in I}|\\mathfrak A(i)|\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(a,b;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;a,b\\in P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{i\\in I:a(i)=b(i)\\}\\in\\mathcal U.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(a,b;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;a,b\\in P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{i\\in I:a(i)=b(i)\\}\\in\\mathcal U.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UClass}_{93}(a;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\\coloneqq\n\\{b\\in P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I):\n\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(a,b;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UClass}_{93}(a;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\\coloneqq\n\\{b\\in P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I):\n\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(a,b;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\nD^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{UClass}_{93}(a;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I):\na\\in P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\nD^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{UClass}_{93}(a;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I):\na\\in P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}(\\bar a,i;m)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle j,\\bar a(j)(i)\\rangle:j&lt;m\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}(\\bar a,i;m)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle j,\\bar a(j)(i)\\rangle:j&lt;m\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FOUClassTuple}_{93}(\\bar a;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,m)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle j,\\mathrm{UClass}_{93}(\\bar a(j);\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\\rangle:j&lt;m\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FOUClassTuple}_{93}(\\bar a;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,m)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle j,\\mathrm{UClass}_{93}(\\bar a(j);\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\\rangle:j&lt;m\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FOUVal}_{93}(f,\\bar a;\\mathfrak A,I,\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle i,\nf^{\\mathfrak A(i)}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}(\\bar a,i;\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f))\n\\bigr)\\right\\rangle:i\\in I\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FOUVal}_{93}(f,\\bar a;\\mathfrak A,I,\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle i,\nf^{\\mathfrak A(i)}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}(\\bar a,i;\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f))\n\\bigr)\\right\\rangle:i\\in I\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UFun}_{93}(f;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\Bigl\\langle{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{FOUClassTuple}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\bar a;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{UClass}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{FOUVal}_{93}(f,\\bar a;\\mathfrak A,I,\\mathcal L);\n\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\rangle:\\bar a\\in\nP^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)}\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UFun}_{93}(f;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\Bigl\\langle{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{FOUClassTuple}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\bar a;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{UClass}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{FOUVal}_{93}(f,\\bar a;\\mathfrak A,I,\\mathcal L);\n\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\rangle:\\bar a\\in\nP^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)}\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{URel}_{93}(r;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{&amp;\\operatorname{FOUClassTuple}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\bar a;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)\\bigr):\\\\\n&amp;\\bar a\\in P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\left\\{i\\in I:\n\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\bar a,i;\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)\\bigr)\n\\in r^{\\mathfrak A(i)}\\right\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{URel}_{93}(r;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{&amp;\\operatorname{FOUClassTuple}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\bar a;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)\\bigr):\\\\\n&amp;\\bar a\\in P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\left\\{i\\in I:\n\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\bar a,i;\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)\\bigr)\n\\in r^{\\mathfrak A(i)}\\right\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{UFunFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle f,\\mathrm{UFun}_{93}(f;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal L)\\rangle:\nf\\in\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{UFunFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle f,\\mathrm{UFun}_{93}(f;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal L)\\rangle:\nf\\in\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{URelFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle r,\\mathrm{URel}_{93}(r;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal L)\\rangle:\nr\\in\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{URelFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle r,\\mathrm{URel}_{93}(r;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal L)\\rangle:\nr\\in\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L)\n\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\langle{}&amp;D^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{UFunFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{URelFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L)\\Bigr\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L)\n\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\langle{}&amp;D^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{UFunFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{URelFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L)\\Bigr\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash{}&amp;\nI\\in V\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathfrak A:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\n\\land P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A(i),\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Bigl[\n\\forall a\\in P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\;\n\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(a,a;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\forall a,b\\in P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(a,b;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\n\\to\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(b,a;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(a,b;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\n\\land\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(b,c;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\n\\to\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(a,c;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n\\forall\\bar a,\\bar b\\in\nP^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)}\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}\\Bigl(\\forall j&lt;\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)\\;\n\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(\\bar a(j),\\bar b(j);\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\\Bigr)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FOUVal}_{93}(f,\\bar a;\\mathfrak A,I,\\mathcal L),\n\\operatorname{FOUVal}_{93}(f,\\bar b;\\mathfrak A,I,\\mathcal L);\n\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\forall r\\in\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n\\forall\\bar a,\\bar b\\in\nP^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)}\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}\\Bigl(\\forall j&lt;\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)\\;\n\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(\\bar a(j),\\bar b(j);\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\\Bigr)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\Bigl(\n\\{i\\in I:\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}(\\bar a,i;\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r))\n\\in r^{\\mathfrak A(i)}\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\leftrightarrow\n\\{i\\in I:\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}(\\bar b,i;\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r))\n\\in r^{\\mathfrak A(i)}\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{UFun}_{93}(f;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal L):\nD^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I)^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)}\n\\to D^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\forall r\\in\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{URel}_{93}(r;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal L)\n\\subseteq D^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I)^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\operatorname{UFunFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L):\n\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\to V\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\operatorname{URelFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L):\n\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\to V\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L),\\mathcal L\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash{}&amp;\nI\\in V\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathfrak A:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\n\\land P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A(i),\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Bigl[\n\\forall a\\in P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\;\n\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(a,a;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\forall a,b\\in P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(a,b;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\n\\to\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(b,a;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(a,b;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\n\\land\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(b,c;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\n\\to\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(a,c;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n\\forall\\bar a,\\bar b\\in\nP^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)}\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}\\Bigl(\\forall j&lt;\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)\\;\n\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(\\bar a(j),\\bar b(j);\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\\Bigr)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FOUVal}_{93}(f,\\bar a;\\mathfrak A,I,\\mathcal L),\n\\operatorname{FOUVal}_{93}(f,\\bar b;\\mathfrak A,I,\\mathcal L);\n\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\forall r\\in\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n\\forall\\bar a,\\bar b\\in\nP^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)}\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}\\Bigl(\\forall j&lt;\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)\\;\n\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(\\bar a(j),\\bar b(j);\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\\Bigr)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\Bigl(\n\\{i\\in I:\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}(\\bar a,i;\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r))\n\\in r^{\\mathfrak A(i)}\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\leftrightarrow\n\\{i\\in I:\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}(\\bar b,i;\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r))\n\\in r^{\\mathfrak A(i)}\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{UFun}_{93}(f;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal L):\nD^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I)^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)}\n\\to D^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\forall r\\in\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{URel}_{93}(r;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal L)\n\\subseteq D^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I)^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\operatorname{UFunFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L):\n\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\to V\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\operatorname{URelFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L):\n\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\to V\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L),\\mathcal L\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Relation symbols are interpreted by ultrafilter-large coordinate truth, not as algebraic operations. Coordinate argument tuples, class tuples, coordinate values, both interpretation-family graphs, the factor-family function, ultrafilter, index set, and language are explicit. The displayed compatibility clauses establish representative independence and hence functionhood of every quotient interpretation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"cc9bc888c7dda430","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ce709e0d2857990","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-set-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"7cc13e0d91069bbd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"cc9bc888c7dda430","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)$, $\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)$, $\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}$, and $\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}$ are sourced from the first-order language encoded in [[93-df-first-order-language]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"I\\neq\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A:I\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A(i),\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UClass}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"D^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FOUClassTuple}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FOUVal}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UFun}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{URel}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UFunFam}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{URelFam}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\nP^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\coloneqq\n\\prod_{i\\in I}|\\mathfrak A(i)|","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(a,b;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&a,b\\in P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\\\\n&\\land\\{i\\in I:a(i)=b(i)\\}\\in\\mathcal U.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UClass}_{93}(a;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\\coloneqq\n\\{b\\in P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I):\n\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(a,b;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\nD^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{UClass}_{93}(a;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I):\na\\in P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}(\\bar a,i;m)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle j,\\bar a(j)(i)\\rangle:j<m\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FOUClassTuple}_{93}(\\bar a;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,m)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle j,\\mathrm{UClass}_{93}(\\bar a(j);\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\\rangle:j<m\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FOUVal}_{93}(f,\\bar a;\\mathfrak A,I,\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle i,\nf^{\\mathfrak A(i)}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}(\\bar a,i;\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f))\n\\bigr)\\right\\rangle:i\\in I\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UFun}_{93}(f;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\Bigl\\langle{}&\n\\operatorname{FOUClassTuple}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\bar a;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)\\bigr),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{UClass}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{FOUVal}_{93}(f,\\bar a;\\mathfrak A,I,\\mathcal L);\n\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\rangle:\\bar a\\in\nP^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)}\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{URel}_{93}(r;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{&\\operatorname{FOUClassTuple}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\bar a;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)\\bigr):\\\\\n&\\bar a\\in P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)}\\\\\n&\\land\\left\\{i\\in I:\n\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\bar a,i;\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)\\bigr)\n\\in r^{\\mathfrak A(i)}\\right\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{UFunFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle f,\\mathrm{UFun}_{93}(f;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal L)\\rangle:\nf\\in\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{URelFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle r,\\mathrm{URel}_{93}(r;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal L)\\rangle:\nr\\in\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L)\n\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\langle{}&D^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I),\\\\\n&\\operatorname{UFunFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L),\\\\\n&\\operatorname{URelFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L)\\Bigr\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}ultraproduct}\\vdash{}&\nI\\in V\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathfrak A:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\n\\land P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A(i),\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&\\to\\Bigl[\n\\forall a\\in P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\;\n\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(a,a;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\\\\\n&\\hspace{3em}\\land\\forall a,b\\in P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(a,b;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\n\\to\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(b,a;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{3em}\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(a,b;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\n\\land\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(b,c;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\n\\to\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(a,c;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{3em}\\land\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n\\forall\\bar a,\\bar b\\in\nP^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)}\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&\\hspace{4em}\\Bigl(\\forall j<\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)\\;\n\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(\\bar a(j),\\bar b(j);\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\\Bigr)\\to\\\\\n&\\hspace{7em}\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FOUVal}_{93}(f,\\bar a;\\mathfrak A,I,\\mathcal L),\n\\operatorname{FOUVal}_{93}(f,\\bar b;\\mathfrak A,I,\\mathcal L);\n\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\hspace{3em}\\land\\forall r\\in\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n\\forall\\bar a,\\bar b\\in\nP^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)}\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&\\hspace{4em}\\Bigl(\\forall j<\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)\\;\n\\mathrm{UEq}_{93}(\\bar a(j),\\bar b(j);\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I)\\Bigr)\\to\\\\\n&\\hspace{7em}\\Bigl(\n\\{i\\in I:\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}(\\bar a,i;\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r))\n\\in r^{\\mathfrak A(i)}\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\\\\n&\\hspace{10em}\\leftrightarrow\n\\{i\\in I:\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}(\\bar b,i;\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r))\n\\in r^{\\mathfrak A(i)}\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\hspace{3em}\\land\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{UFun}_{93}(f;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal L):\nD^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I)^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)}\n\\to D^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{3em}\\land\\forall r\\in\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{URel}_{93}(r;\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U,I,\\mathcal L)\n\\subseteq D^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I)^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{3em}\\land\\operatorname{UFunFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L):\n\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\to V\\\\\n&\\hspace{3em}\\land\\operatorname{URelFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L):\n\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\to V\\\\\n&\\hspace{3em}\\land\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L),\\mathcal L\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":8196,"backlinks":[{"id":"e960a212d7978b44","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4e07e37041cb639b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{FOUClassTuple}_{93}$, $\\operatorname{FOUArg}_{93}$, and $\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}$ are the fully indexed constructors of [[93-df-first-order-ultraproduct]]."},{"id":"602433be409bad14","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-ultraproduct]]"}],"outgoing":["cc9bc888c7dda430","0ce709e0d2857990","7cc13e0d91069bbd"]}